# panel-src phase 12 — Task 68 / Phase 12 (Nov 2026): Holoo LIVE-integration
# stabilization — robust response extraction + probe diagnostics.
#
# ROOT CAUSE this patch fixes: the live service (owner field test, Nov 2026)
# wraps every list in a business-named envelope — Customer → {"Customer":[…]},
# Product → {"product":[…]} (lowercase), Report/GetCustPay → {"report":[…]}.
# The old extractItems() only knew data/list/items/records/result and fell
# through to "return [o]" — the WHOLE envelope became one bogus record with
# no business fields, so the live manual sync imported ZERO records while
# the bare-array mock suite stayed green.
#
# Changes (4 files):
#   src/lib/holoo.ts
#     · extractHolooItemsDetailed(): bounded (≤3 levels) recursive
#       unwrapping; case-insensitive known wrappers (customer[s],
#       product[s], invoice[s], report[s] + the generic data/list/items/
#       records/result[s]); single-record objects; an object that BOTH
#       carries a wrapper-named key AND business fields is a RECORD
#       (e.g. an invoice's "Customer" name string), never unwrapped.
#     · explicit diagnostics: kind (array|wrapped|single|unrecognized),
#       wrapper (as received), normalized shape, count, first-record
#       FIELD NAMES (never values), top-level response keys, depth.
#       A VALID EMPTY list ({"Customer":[]}) is 'wrapped' count 0 —
#       'unrecognized' is reserved for unextractable bodies.
#     · probe(): reports elapsedMs, timeoutMs, kind, wrapper, count,
#       firstRecordKeys + classified failure (errorKind) — never
#       credentials, tokens, URLs or record VALUES (Task 12.2).
#     · probeTimeoutMs()/invoiceProbeTimeoutMs(): separately configurable
#       diagnostic budgets (MEDPAD_HOLOO_PROBE_TIMEOUT_MS default 10 s,
#       MEDPAD_HOLOO_INVOICE_PROBE_TIMEOUT_MS default 30 s) — the sync's
#       30 s timeout is untouched (Task 12.5: no global inflation).
#     · extractItems() kept as a backward-compatible items-only shim.
#   src/lib/holoo-sync.ts
#     · every section (customers/products/invoices) reports an honest
#       Persian error when the response is 'unrecognized' (run = partial);
#       per-customer payment reports aggregate into ONE summary error.
#       Valid empty lists stay SUCCESS. Key names only, never values.
#   src/app/api/admin/holoo/test/route.ts
#     · Invoice/Invoice probe uses its own diagnostic timeout; response
#       carries probeTimeouts for UI transparency. Read-only, unchanged
#       endpoints — no invented paths or parameters.
#   src/components/panel/HolooTab.tsx
#     · probe table: HTTP status + elapsed ms per endpoint, detected
#       wrapper, extracted record count + outcome label, first-record
#       field names; failures show the classified error; timeouts show
#       the diagnostic budget that applied.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
